<WaitlistLegalPage title="Data Grid early offer">
  <p>Join the AWC UI Data Grid waitlist before its commercial launch to receive <strong>20% off your first annual Data Grid purchase</strong>.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The discount covers the first annual billing period only.</li>
    <li>Redeem the offer during the first 30 days after Data Grid’s commercial launch.</li>
    <li>Renewals use the standard price disclosed before purchase.</li>
    <li>The offer is for Data Grid. Other future Pro products are not included.</li>
    <li>We will provide redemption instructions at launch. Eligibility may need to be verified against the signup address when purchasing.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Joining is free. No payment is taken, no subscription starts, and you are not required to buy. Signup does not reserve a price, release date, or final feature set. Product pricing and license terms will be shown before purchase.</p>
  <p>You can unsubscribe from waitlist emails without losing your early offer eligibility. If you unsubscribe, contact <a href="mailto:waitlist@awc-ui.dev">waitlist@awc-ui.dev</a> during the redemption period for help claiming the offer.</p>
  <p>Read the <a href="/privacy/">waitlist privacy notice</a> for details about your information.</p>
</WaitlistLegalPage>
